{"seq":3,"slug":"identity-stitching-cross-device-privacy","title":"匿名-登录身份拼合与跨设备归并（含隐私边界）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/abandonment-detection-event-identity/identity-stitching-cross-device-privacy","wordCount":2706,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"匿名-登录身份拼合与跨设备归并-含隐私边界\">匿名-登录身份拼合与跨设备归并（含隐私边界）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>弃购挽回引擎的第一性问题是：<strong>同一个人在两台设备、三个会话、一次登录后，算几个用户？</strong> 若答案是&quot;四个&quot;，一个访客在手机加购、在桌面登录结账时犹豫退出，系统就会在两个&quot;用户&quot;上各开一条挽回旅程——重复发券、重复触达，把同一预算花两次。身份拼合（identity stitching / identity resolution）就是把 <code>anonymous_id</code>（匿名设备/会话标识）与 <code>user_id</code>（已认证账号）归并到一个**规范身份（canonical profile）**上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;匿名浏览&lt;br/&gt;cookie/localStorage&lt;br/&gt;anonymous_id&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;识别信号采集&lt;br/&gt;device / IP / UA / hashed email&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;拼合判定&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|确定性键命中| D[&quot;归并到&lt;br/&gt;canonical_profile_id&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|概率性相似| D&#10;  C --&gt;|同意缺失| E[&quot;信号丢弃&lt;br/&gt;仅保留会话级&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;跨设备视图&lt;br/&gt;同一人的所有 cart/order&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;弃购事件去重&lt;br/&gt;按 profile 聚合&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[\"匿名浏览&lt;br/&gt;cookie/localStorage&lt;br/&gt;anonymous_id\"] --&gt; B[\"识别信号采集&lt;br/&gt;device / IP / UA / hashed email\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"拼合判定\"}\n  C --&gt;|确定性键命中| D[\"归并到&lt;br/&gt;canonical_profile_id\"]\n  C --&gt;|概率性相似| D\n  C --&gt;|同意缺失| E[\"信号丢弃&lt;br/&gt;仅保留会话级\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"跨设备视图&lt;br/&gt;同一人的所有 cart/order\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"弃购事件去重&lt;br/&gt;按 profile 聚合\"]\n  E --&gt; G</pre><p>判定手段分三类，成本、准确率与合规风险完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>典型信号</th>\n<th>准确率</th>\n<th>同意依赖</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>确定性</td>\n<td>登录 <code>user_id</code>、哈希邮箱/手机号、订单号</td>\n<td>高（近 1.0）</td>\n<td>低（第一方或履约必需）</td>\n<td>登录用户跨设备归并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率性</td>\n<td>IP + UA 指纹、设备图、时间邻近性</td>\n<td>中（常 0.5–0.9）</td>\n<td>高（多需同意）</td>\n<td>无登录的双设备合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建模推定</td>\n<td>GA4/Ads consent mode 建模、平台聚合归因</td>\n<td>低（聚合级）</td>\n<td>平台承担</td>\n<td>同意缺失时保留方向性统计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区别在<strong>归属粒度</strong>：确定性拼合告诉你&quot;这个 cart 属于 user_42&quot;，概率性拼合只说&quot;这两台设备大概率同人&quot;，建模推定根本不产出个体级归并，只在报表层补回被拒绝的转化量。后者能救报表，救不了挽回旅程——你不能给一个&quot;统计上存在的用户&quot;发短信。三者必须分开存储、分开授权。</p>\n<h3 id=\"匿名标识的实际形态\">匿名标识的实际形态</h3><p>不同采集栈产出的匿名标识不可互换，拼合前须先归一化到内部 <code>canonical_profile_id</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>GA4 Web</strong>：<code>_ga</code> cookie 内为 <code>GA1.1.&lt;domain_part&gt;.&lt;timestamp&gt;</code>，<code>client_id</code> 即 <code>&lt;domain_part&gt;.&lt;timestamp&gt;</code>，跨域、子域场景下并不稳定（Google Analytics 帮助中心 &quot;Identity spaces&quot;）；<code>_ga_&lt;container-id&gt;</code> 另载会话状态。</li>\n<li><strong>Firebase/移动端</strong>：<code>app_instance_id</code>，随重装或清数据重置，天然不可跨设备。</li>\n<li><strong>服务端与 CDP</strong>：服务端采集常用 First-Party ID（<code>FPID</code>）在第一方域种 cookie；Segment 的 <code>anonymousId</code>/<code>userId</code>、Adobe Experience Platform 的 ECID、Salesforce Data Cloud 的 profile id 是各自命名空间的等价物。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把所有外部标识作为&quot;边&quot;挂到内部 ID 上，换采集栈时只改映射层，弃购事件模型不动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性拼合-从-anonymous_id-到登录身份\">确定性拼合：从 anonymous_id 到登录身份</h2><p>确定性拼合的本质是<strong>在身份图上连边</strong>。典型连边时机有三个：<strong>登录/注册</strong>（请求同时带 <code>anonymous_id</code> 与刚认证的 <code>user_id</code>，最干净的一条边）、<strong>结账/下单</strong>（订单携 email/phone，与已哈希联系人记录比对命中）、<strong>邮件/短信点击</strong>（链接带 <code>contact_id</code> 与落地页 <code>anonymous_id</code>，跳转服务在同一请求内绑定）。一条典型 <code>identify</code> 载荷：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;event&quot;: &quot;identify&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ts&quot;: &quot;2026-10-05T10:12:03Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;traits&quot;: { &quot;canonical_profile_id&quot;: &quot;p_9f2c&quot;, &quot;email_sha256&quot;: &quot;…&quot; },&#10;  &quot;anonymous_id&quot;: &quot;a_1b7e&quot;,&#10;  &quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;u_8842&quot;,&#10;  &quot;context&quot;: { &quot;source&quot;: &quot;checkout_login&quot;, &quot;consent&quot;: { &quot;ad_storage&quot;: &quot;denied&quot; } }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"identify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-05T10:12:03Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"traits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"canonical_profile_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p_9f2c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"email_sha256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"anonymous_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a_1b7e\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_8842\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"context\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"checkout_login\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"consent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ad_storage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"denied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>收到后，在 <code>(anonymous_id, canonical_profile_id)</code> 与 <code>(user_id, canonical_profile_id)</code> 上各写一条边；若 <code>anonymous_id</code> 已属于另一个 profile，则触发<strong>合并（merge）</strong>——这正是复杂度所在。四条必须固化的规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>合并方向与幂等</strong>：以最早出现的 profile 为合并目标（或按&quot;账号 &gt; 设备&quot;的权威序），被合并 profile 写墓碑，其所有边重指向新 profile。合并必须幂等，否则重放的事件流会造出环路。</li>\n<li><strong>不可逆要退到&quot;可撤销&quot;</strong>：误合并（家人共用平板、共享出口 IP）比漏合并更危险——它把两个人的购物车搅在一起。要么保留 <code>merge_log</code> 支持 split，要么<strong>软合并</strong>：只在查询层视图展开，物理表不动。</li>\n<li><strong>按事件时间而非到达时间</strong>：分布式采集常乱序到达，<code>ts</code> 早的登录可能晚于 <code>ts</code> 晚的浏览被处理，故合并判定须按事件时间排序后的边集计算连通分量。</li>\n<li><strong>图结构用并查集</strong>：<code>canonical_profile_id</code> 即连通分量代表元。边数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 远小于点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，故只存<strong>边表</strong>比存全量映射更省空间，也天然支持重算：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>profile</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>u</mi><mtext> 与 </mtext><mi>v</mi><mtext> 在 </mtext><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 中连通</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{profile}(v) = \\{ u \\in V \\mid u \\text{ 与 } v \\text{ 在 } G=(V,E) \\text{ 中连通} \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">profile</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">与</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">中连通</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"跨设备归并-设备图与概率性匹配\">跨设备归并：设备图与概率性匹配</h2><p>当用户始终不登录时，只剩概率性信号。常见做法是<strong>设备图（device graph）</strong>：以 IP 段、UA 指纹、时区、屏幕尺寸、字体列表、Canvas/WebGL 指纹等特征聚类。欧美主流供给方包括 LiveRamp（RampID）与 The Trade Desk（Unified ID 2.0，<code>unifiedid.com</code>），思路是在中立命名空间下做以哈希邮箱/手机为键的确定性同步，而非纯指纹。各信号可信度差异很大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>假阳性来源</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希邮箱 / 手机号</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>共享邮箱、公司邮箱</td>\n<td>需归一化（小写、去空格、E.164）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>登录态 OAuth（<code>sub</code>）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>一账号多人用</td>\n<td>见 OpenID Connect Core 1.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP + UA</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>运营商 NAT、公司出口、VPN</td>\n<td>只能作加权证据，不可单独连边</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Canvas/WebGL 指纹</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>同型号同系统设备</td>\n<td>属&quot;访问终端信息&quot;，EU 下需同意</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>概率判定常用两个可计算量：特征集合的 Jaccard 相似度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(A,B)=|A\\cap B|/|A\\cup B|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，以及把每个信号视为独立证据的似然比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>same</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>diff</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda=\\prod_i P(s_i\\mid H_{\\text{same}})/P(s_i\\mid H_{\\text{diff}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">same</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">diff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda&gt;\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 时连边。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 直接决定假阳性率：对弃购挽回而言，误合并的代价（给错人发券、泄露他人购物车内容）远高于漏合并，因此工程上普遍<strong>偏保守</strong>，宁可不合并、让其作为匿名会话存在。这也是头部电商的个体级跨设备归并绝大多数发生在<strong>登录之后</strong>的原因——匿名段的概率归并只用于聚合分析，不进入触达链路。</p>\n<p>另一个常被忽视的细节是<strong>家庭与个人之别</strong>。同 IP、同设备、不同登录账号在 GDPR 语境下通常应识别为不同数据主体（Recital 30 明确设备标识可关联自然人），把家人合并成一个 profile 会导致&quot;用妈妈的账号看爸爸的浏览记录&quot;这类投诉。可行做法是打 <code>household_id</code> 与 <code>person_id</code> 两层，触达只认 <code>person_id</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私边界-同意-最小化与地区规则\">隐私边界：同意、最小化与地区规则</h2><p>身份拼合在监管上几乎必然触到&quot;处理个人数据&quot;与&quot;访问终端信息&quot;两条线。工程上要落地的边界有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>法律基础</strong>：EU 下把浏览/设备标识用于广告或跨站追踪通常需<strong>同意</strong>（GDPR Art. 6(1)(a)），而非&quot;合法利益&quot;；Cookie/本地存储的读写另受 ePrivacy Directive 2002/58/EC Art. 5(3) 约束（细化见 ICO 2024 存储访问技术指南）。</li>\n<li><strong>标识符即个人数据</strong>：GDPR Recital 30 写明 IP、cookie 标识可用于识别自然人，因此可关联的 <code>anonymous_id</code> 并非&quot;非个人数据&quot;，不能靠改名叫&quot;匿名&quot;来脱敏。</li>\n<li><strong>同意信号必须真消费</strong>：Google Consent Mode v2 自 2024 年 3 月起在 EEA 成为广告个性化与再营销的硬前提；未正确传递 <code>ad_storage</code>/<code>ad_user_data</code>/<code>ad_personalization</code> 的站点，广告侧身份信号会被丢弃（Google 官方 &quot;Consent mode&quot; 文档）。ICCL 2024 年就此向监管投诉，说明&quot;传了信号&quot;不等于&quot;同意了&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>同意框架未必免责</strong>：IAB Europe 的 TCF v2.2 是最常见的同意载体，但其自身在 2022 年被比利时数据保护局裁定承担责任，当作&quot;免责工具&quot;是误判。</li>\n<li><strong>第三方 cookie 的现实</strong>：Google 于 2025 年 4 月宣布<strong>不再</strong>在 Chrome 中弃用第三方 cookie（blog.chromium.org, &quot;A new path for Privacy Sandbox on the web&quot;），但用户侧三方 cookie 控制与隐私沙盒仍在推进。&quot;三方 cookie 会消失&quot;的假设已过期，正确策略是<strong>第一方优先</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>移动端与其他辖区</strong>：iOS 的 ATT（2021 起）使跨应用追踪需显式授权，Apple 后续以 AdAttributionKit 承接归因；巴西 LGPD 与加州 CCPA/CPRA 各设选择退出与敏感信息限制，跨境卖家面对的是<strong>并集</strong>而非单一规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>落地方针只有一句话：<strong>默认不拼合、默认不触达</strong>——未取得同意的匿名标识只保留会话生命周期内用于履约与反欺诈，不做跨设备归并、不做跨渠道触达；同意可撤销，撤回后必须把该标识从触达名单与设备图中摘除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现-身份注册表与治理\">工程实现：身份注册表与治理</h2><p>把上述规则落成可维护组件，就是<strong>身份注册表（identity registry）</strong>，由三张表构成：<code>identity_edge(src_id, src_type, canonical_profile_id, edge_type, confidence, first_seen, last_seen)</code>（边表，唯一真相源）、<code>profile(canonical_profile_id, created_at, merged_into, consent_state, region)</code>（分量代表元与合规状态）、<code>merge_log(from_profile, to_profile, reason, at, actor)</code>（审计与回滚）。治理上有几点必须内建：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>删除的传播</strong>：GDPR Art. 17 的删除权在身份图里是<strong>图操作</strong>——删一个 <code>user_id</code> 要把其所有匿名边一并摘除，否则残留边仍能反推出此人。删除请求须转成&quot;移除该节点全部关联边 + 分量重算&quot;，而非只删账号行。</li>\n<li><strong>同意状态参与归并判定</strong>：把 <code>consent_state</code> 作为边的一等属性，未同意的边不参与跨设备归并，只参与会话内履约。</li>\n<li><strong>可观测指标</strong>：监控登录拼合命中率、分量大小分布（异常大的分量是误合并信号）、假合并率。分量中位数突然抬升通常意味着某个指纹信号退化，需立刻降权。</li>\n<li><strong>时延预算</strong>：拼合发生在结账与弃购判定之间，通常要求秒级，故采用<strong>在线查边 + 异步重算分量</strong>：请求路径只做一次边查询，重分量计算与合并落盘由 Flink/Kafka 流式作业异步完成。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最小闭环：在线 API 收 <code>identify</code> → 写边 → 查/建 <code>canonical_profile_id</code> 并回写业务事件 → 异步作业按事件时间重算连通分量、应用阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>、产出合并或拆分 → 变更写入 <code>merge_log</code> 并触发触达名单更新。即使异步作业短暂延迟，在线侧仍能给出一致、可解释的答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>弃购挽回的正确性始于身份口径：<code>anonymous_id</code> 与 <code>user_id</code> 必须归并到内部 <code>canonical_profile_id</code>。拼合分确定性、概率性、建模推定三类；后者只能补报表，<strong>不能</strong>进入个体触达链路。</li>\n<li>确定性拼合用边表 + 并查集实现，必须幂等、按事件时间重算、支持拆分；概率性匹配用 Jaccard / 似然比加阈值，并对家庭与个人分层。误合并代价高于漏合并。</li>\n<li>隐私边界不是事后脱敏：GDPR Recital 30 视标识符为个人数据，ePrivacy Art. 5(3) 与 Consent Mode v2 要求同意先行；删除权在图上是边删除操作。默认姿态应是&quot;默认不拼合、默认不触达&quot;，同意撤回后必须从名单与设备图摘除。</li>\n<li>需长期监控登录拼合命中率、分量大小分布与假合并率，把身份质量当作与转化率同级的核心指标。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>同章节相关：<a href=\"abandonment-funnel-stage-taxonomy\">弃购漏斗阶段与分类口径</a> · <a href=\"cart-checkout-event-stream-modeling\">购物车与结账事件流建模</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"匿名-登录身份拼合与跨设备归并（含隐私边界）","id":"匿名-登录身份拼合与跨设备归并-含隐私边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"匿名标识的实际形态","id":"匿名标识的实际形态"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性拼合：从 anonymous_id 到登录身份","id":"确定性拼合-从-anonymous_id-到登录身份"},{"level":2,"text":"跨设备归并：设备图与概率性匹配","id":"跨设备归并-设备图与概率性匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私边界：同意、最小化与地区规则","id":"隐私边界-同意-最小化与地区规则"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现：身份注册表与治理","id":"工程实现-身份注册表与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"购物车/结算事件建模与实时流失信号流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/abandonment-detection-event-identity/cart-checkout-event-stream-modeling"},"next":{"title":"挽回旅程状态机与进入/退出/冷却条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/abandoned-cart-recovery-lifecycle-messaging-orchestration/recovery-journey-orchestration-engine/journey-state-machine-exit-conditions"}}